<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>{{ ansible_hostname }} · 鸢航 VirtKite</title>
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; min-height: 100vh; display: grid; place-items: center;
           font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
           background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2a9da5, #217d83); color: #fff; }
    .card { text-align: center; padding: 3rem 4rem; }
    h1 { font-size: 2.4rem; margin: 0 0 .6rem; letter-spacing: .04em; }
    p { opacity: .85; margin: .3rem 0; }
    code { background: rgba(255,255,255,.16); padding: .15rem .5rem; border-radius: 4px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <h1>鸢航 VirtKite</h1>
    <p>本页由 Ansible role <code>nginx</code> 渲染下发</p>
    <p>主机：<code>{{ ansible_hostname }}</code> ｜ 发行版：<code>{{ ansible_distribution }} {{ ansible_distribution_version }}</code></p>
    <p>内网地址：<code>{{ ansible_default_ipv4.address | default('—') }}</code></p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
